{
  "_meta": {
    "component": "gating",
    "version": "1.0.0",
    "created_at": "2026-11-20",
    "description": "P10.T2 eval set: a turn plus retrieved memory candidates labeled with the CBDC gate decision per candidate (use = inject into the prompt, verify = relevant but untrusted/stale/contradicted and needs a verification step, ignore = not worth the budget). expected_output.budget accounts only for use decisions under the pipeline defaults (budget_claims=3, budget_chars=1200): claims_used counts use decisions, chars_used sums the character length of used candidates' text fields."
  },
